id: pm-github-gaq8
title: closeout-workflow.test.ts fails wholesale on the local shared host while CI stays green on main
description: "Running the closeout workflow suite on the package worktree fails nearly every test on pristine main (assertions receive git branch-switch output and a pm 'Command failed' receipt instead of expected diagnostics), while the CI workflow on the same main commit is green. The suite also exceeds 4 minutes locally and hits local timeouts. Root-cause the host-local incompatibility (host git version prints advice output the fixtures do not expect) or make the fixtures version-tolerant; out of scope for the release-tag normalization work."
